## Why dual-license?

The copyleft terms of AGPL-3.0 ensure that improvements to this
software remain open-source. The commercial option allows for-profit
use under terms that do not require source disclosure.

This is the same licensing model used by the related projects
py-idp (AI IDP framework) and crouzeix_CN (Crouzeix ratio
verification), both by the same author.